WEBVTT

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:33.926
OK, this is going to be
a different kind of ad.

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:37.310
I've played a personal role
in selecting the sponsors for this podcast

00:21:37.334 --> 00:21:39.977
because they all have
interesting cultures of their own.

00:21:40.001 --> 00:21:42.595
Today, we're going inside
the workplace at Hilton.

00:21:43.087 --> 00:21:45.846
We had recorded a story back in February.

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:47.466
Then the world changed,

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:49.395
so we decided to do something different,

00:21:49.419 --> 00:21:51.575
to speak to the moment we're living in.

00:21:51.599 --> 00:21:53.692
(Music)

00:21:53.716 --> 00:21:55.163
Charles Hill: I was in denial.

00:21:55.187 --> 00:21:58.117
We weren't going to be impacted.
We're making it out of this.

00:21:58.141 --> 00:22:00.979
And it was that moment,
it was 4:30 on a Friday, March 6.